{"id":"renta","lemma":"renta","pos":"noun","rank":3224,"glosses":["income","rent","protection money"],"ipa":"/ˈrenta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"rentas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-renta.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me olvidé de pagar la renta.","en":"I forgot to pay the rent.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519635","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to forget","l":"olvidar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to pay"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuándo te toca pagar la renta?","en":"When's your rent due?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"kerchief, turban cloth"},{"g":"to pay"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Subiremos la renta el próximo mes.","en":"We'll increase the rent next month.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/769463","words":[{"g":"to go up or come up","l":"subir"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"near"},{"g":"month"}]},{"text":"Paga tu renta por adelantado.","en":"Pay your rent in advance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804366","words":[{"g":"payment"},{"g":"your"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"in advance"]]},{"text":"Apenas puedo pagar la renta.","en":"I can barely pay my rent.","words":[{"g":"barely, scarcely"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to pay"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}